kiln reimplements parts of Ninja (https://ninja-build.org) in Go, porting
its manifest parser, build log and deps log formats, dependency scan,
build plan and command runner statement by statement:

  Ninja
  Copyright 2011 Google Inc. All Rights Reserved.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

internal/state/hash.go ports two hash functions:

  MurmurHash64A, by Austin Appleby, placed in the public domain, as
  vendored in Ninja's src/build_log.cc (Ninja 1.10-1.12).

  rapidhash, as vendored in Ninja 1.13 (src/third_party/rapidhash):

